# --- Personal / scratch content ---
# Local backup snapshots — likely contains unscrubbed project-specific
# references, review before ever removing this line.
local-backup/
local-docs/

# Scratch or in-progress notes not yet generalized for public sharing
**/scratch/
**/*-draft.md
**/*.local.md
**/*.local.*

# --- Secrets / environment ---
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets/

# --- OS junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Editor / IDE ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# --- Agent/tool runtime artifacts (adjust if not applicable) ---
.opencode/
.claude/settings.local.json
*.log